    <statement><p>If <m>z = f(x) + y g(x)</m>, what can we say about <m>z_{yy}</m>?</p>
<p><var form="buttons">
<li>
<p><m>z_{yy} = g(x)</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>z_{yy} = y</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>z_{yy} = z_{xx}</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>z_{yy} = 0</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p>We cannot say anything</p>
</li>
</var></p>
</statement>
